# The submission is distributed as a folder or a ZIP, not a git clone, and neither
# resolves LFS pointers. Anything a recipient must be able to open therefore has to be
# a plain git object: the Unreal project assets (above, untracked) and the report
# figures (below, filters unset). Vendored third-party images stay in LFS; nothing
# depends on them.
docs/*.png !filter !diff !merge -text
